# Sandboxed Communication Rules

- Platform-Only Communication: All interactions between tutors and students must occur strictly within the platform.
- Anti-Bypass Guardrails: Prevent sharing of raw external contact info (phone numbers, external links) inside the Stream Chat channels.
- Private Channels: Each lesson room must have an isolated Stream Chat channel scoped strictly to the assigned tutor and student ID.